WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.800
Start by adding your profile photo, creator name, and a short bio.

00:07.800 --> 00:15.500
Next, create a membership tier. Give it a name and set your monthly price.

00:15.500 --> 00:25.000
Add the benefits members receive. The live preview updates as you build.

00:25.000 --> 00:32.550
When everything looks right, preview the finished page your fans will see.

00:32.550 --> 00:37.000
Then publish your page and share it with your audience.
